      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To detect labels or objects in a static image, I will use the Amazon Rekognition service, which is a concrete external provider. I will import the necessary modules from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Rekognition client to detect labels in an image. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the 'boto3' module and the use of the 'rekognition' client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789889650424,
          "start": 1789889648327
        },
        "type": "text"
